# A whole match by keys at the desktop size: New Game, then Enter on each turn
# (the focus starts on Pass (0) when you bid and on your first playable card
# when you play) until the five rounds end with the final score.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Press New Game
frames 20
click =New Game
until 120 Your bid
frames 10
repeat 30000 until Final — Team A
  key Enter 1
  frames 20
end
frames 60
expect Results
expect Round 5 / 5
save desk-results
